<tr>


<td style="width:40%;word-break:break-all;" align="left" class="titleFieldValue">5.4.15 JSW Coated Specific General Instructions to Suppliers</td>





<td>&nbsp;</td>

</tr>

<tr>
<td style="width:40%" align="left" class="descriptionFieldValue">
JSW SCPL is certified with QMS (Quality Management System) ISO 9001:2015. We also urge you to go for QMS certification for continual improvement in your processes & betterment in quality of your products / services. JSW SCPL is certified with ISO 45001:2018 (OHSAS: Occupational Health & Safety Assessment Series). We follow safe working practices at our works. You are requested to follow the safe practices at your works. You are also requested to follow all safety rules & regulations while being in our company premises. You shall obtain permit from the respective location in-charge before entering into any plant area. You shall provide adequate PPEs (uniforms, helmets, safety shoes, safety harness etc.) to your staff as per site requirement. JSW SCPL is certified for ISO 14001: 2015 (EMS: Environment Management System). We take utmost care in preservation of Environment. You are requested to take care of the environment & restrain your staff from making any harm the environment. Please provide Material Safety Data Sheet (MSDS) & information regarding environmental impact / hazard of your product, wherever applicable, at the time of delivery. JSW SCPL is certified for ISO 50001: 2011 (EnMS: Energy Management System). JSW SCPL is committed for conservation of energy. Your offer shall be evaluated on the basis of energy efficiency & Life Cycle of your product wherever applicable / necessary. JSW SCPL is certified with ISO 22000:2018 (FSMS: Food Safety Management System) for our Tinning Line at Tarapur. You are requested to ensure the products / services supplied by you for use in our Tinning Line should comply with Food Grade requirement & you shall submit the necessary documentary evidences to JSW SCPL at the time of supply or as & when requested by JSW. You are requested to fulfill the selection criteria mentioned in our RFP while submitting the offer. You are also requested to instruct your workmen to maintain personal hygiene & cleanliness while deputed to work at our Tinning Line. You shall also ensure that the materials / services provided during execution of service contract should be Food Grade quality. We encourage our suppliers to have QMS, EMS, EnMS, OHSAS & FSMS certifications. You may inform us for any assistance required during the process of certification. JSW SCPL is a leading steel manufacturer in India. We believe & follow ethical practices. We request you to adhere to the ethical practices in all the business transactions with JSW SCPL. In case of any issue, you can discuss the matter with Mr. Ranjit Majumdar, GM – Commercial.
</td>

<td>&nbsp;</td>

</tr>



